---
/**
 * The landing page's body, below the hero.
 *
 * THE THREE-WAY SWITCH IS GONE. From 2026-08-19 this file rendered three candidate bodies behind a
 * preview control so the choice could be made by reading them on the deployed portal rather than
 * from a description. Oleh picked A on 2026-08-20, and the switch, the two losing components and
 * `lib/landing-switch.ts` went in the same commit. That was the plan from the day they shipped: a
 * comparison instrument earns its place by being deleted once it has answered.
 *
 * `data-pagefind-ignore` stays. The home is navigation rather than an answer, and a search result
 * that lands you back on the home page is a result that failed. It also kept `/` from becoming the
 * strongest match for half the vocabulary of the site while three copies of one directory were in
 * the DOM at once.
 */
import LandingBody from './landing/LandingBody.astro';
---

<div data-pagefind-ignore><LandingBody /></div>
